<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Smart Invoice!</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;
      max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; } .header {
      background-color: #4f46e5; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align:
      center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; } .content { background-color:
      #f9fafb; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; } .button { display:
      inline-block; background-color: #4f46e5; color: white; padding: 15px 30px;
      text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; font-weight:
      bold; } .features { background-color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius:
      8px; margin: 20px 0; } .feature-item { margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;
      position: relative; } .feature-item:before { content: "✓"; position:
      absolute; left: 0; color: #059669; font-weight: bold; } .footer {
      text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px
      solid #e5e7eb; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🎉 Welcome to Smart Invoice!</h1>
      <p>Your journey to smarter invoicing starts here</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>

      <p>Welcome to Smart Invoice! We're excited to have you on board. Your
        account has been successfully created and you're ready to start managing
        your invoices more efficiently.</p>

      <div class="features">
        <h3>What you can do with Smart Invoice:</h3>
        <div class="feature-item">Create and send professional invoices</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Track payments and manage clients</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Generate detailed reports and analytics</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Set up automated payment reminders</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Export invoices as PDF documents</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Manage your business finances effortlessly</div>
      </div>

      <p>Ready to get started? Click the button below to access your dashboard:</p>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Go to Dashboard</a>
      </div>

      <p>Your account details:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}</li>
        <li><strong>Account created:</strong> Today</li>
      </ul>

      <p>If you have any questions or need help getting started, don't hesitate
        to reach out to our support team.</p>

      <p>Happy invoicing!<br />
        The Smart Invoice Team</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated welcome email. If you didn't create this account,
        please contact our support team.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>